# Audio files directory
# Place your song audio files (.mp3) and MIDI files (.mid) here
# 
# Expected files:
# - slow-groove.mp3 + slow-groove.mid (80 BPM)
# - steady-beat.mp3 + steady-beat.mid (100 BPM)
# - upbeat-fun.mp3 + upbeat-fun.mid (120 BPM)
#
# Each audio file should include a 1-measure count-in at the beginning.
# The MIDI file should have quarter notes marking each beat, including the count-in.

